       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Sx or a palpable lump:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " breast US = USU the first test; if it = abnorm or unclear, mammography follows; if imaging suggests CA, bx"
     }
    ]
   },
